Subject: [PATCH 15] bpf: protect mapless stack-only programs

Select the existing exact-frame path for a verified SOCKET_FILTER with stack
use and no map. Publish its stack access metadata, require the protected JIT,
and omit the map gateway and per-program vmalloc stack. Unsupported accesses
still reject.

